OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786744250
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cdetected on third farm in Scotland
OL,6,FThe potentially deadly bluetongue
OL,7,Fvirus has been detected on a third
OL,8,Ffarm in southern Scotland.
OL,10,FIt comes after the Johnson family, who
OL,11,Frun Kirkmabreck Farm in Dumfries and
OL,12,FGalloway, confirmed one of their lambs
OL,13,Fhad the virus on August 8. A single
OL,14,Flamb was affected.
OL,16,FThe new case has been found in a sheep
OL,17,Fon premises less than 2km from the
OL,18,Fexisting two confirmed cases in the
OL,19,Farea.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/5
