FL,322,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786744250
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cdetected on third farm in Scotland
OL,6,FA second case of bluetongue serotype 3
OL,7,F(BTV-3) was confirmed in two sheep on
OL,8,Fa different farm on Wednesday, August
OL,9,F12.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Government said all three
OL,12,Ffarms have been placed under
OL,13,Frestriction while investigations
OL,14,Fcontinue.
OL,16,FChief veterinary officer Sheila Voas
OL,17,Fsaid: "Bluetongue has been detected on
OL,18,Fa third farm in south-west Scotland
OL,19,Finvolving one sheep.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/5
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,322,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786744250
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cdetected on third farm in Scotland
OL,6,F"This premises is less than 2km from
OL,7,Fthe existing two confirmed cases
OL,8,F(three individual animals) in the same
OL,9,Fparish.
OL,11,F"All three farms are under restriction
OL,12,Fwhile investigations, including
OL,13,Ftesting other susceptible animals, are
OL,14,Fongoing.
OL,16,F"Vaccination remains the best way of
OL,17,Fpreventing disease in animals, and I
OL,18,Fencourage all farmers to discuss this
OL,19,Fwith their vets."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/5
