PN,32104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786744250
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cdetected on third farm in Scotland
OL,6,FAll animals known to be affected have
OL,7,Fbeen euthanised.
OL,9,FBluetongue only affects animals and
OL,10,Fdoes not affect humans or food safety,
OL,11,Fand it is mainly spread by biting
OL,12,Fmidges.
OL,14,FIt is a notifiable disease, meaning
OL,15,Fany suspected cases are legally
OL,16,Frequired to be reported to the Animal
OL,17,Fand Plant Health Agency.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/5
