PN,32105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786744250
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cdetected on third farm in Scotland
OL,6,FSymptoms include nasal discharge,
OL,7,Fredness and swelling of the lips, nose
OL,8,Fand muzzle, lameness or reluctance to
OL,9,Fstand, decreased milk production and
OL,10,Fdiarrhoea in cattle.
OL,12,FIt is also potentially fatal for
OL,13,Faffected animals.
OL,15,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,16,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,17,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,18,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,19,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,20,Fbelow...
